# KAMAL DZ STUDIO 2027

KAMAL DZ STUDIO 2027 is an open-source Android AI creative studio that brings multiple AI-powered creative workflows into one application with an Arabic RTL interface.

## Features

- Generation Studio — AI image and creative generation workflows
- Character Studio — character creation and consistency workflows
- Voice Studio — voice and audio workflows
- Music Studio — AI music creation
- Editing/Montage Studio — video editing and montage workflows
- Library Studio — projects and media management
- Export Studio — export and delivery workflows
- Arabic RTL interface
- Firebase App Check and security protections
- Server-side AI processing architecture designed to keep provider secrets out of the Android client

## Build and Run

1. Clone or download the repository.
2. Open the Android project in Android Studio.
3. Allow Gradle to synchronize the project.
4. Configure the required Firebase project and Android configuration.
5. Build and run the application on a compatible Android device or emulator.

Project-specific development and preservation rules are documented in `AGENTS.md`.

## Project Status

KAMAL DZ STUDIO 2027 is actively developed as an open-source Android AI creative studio.

## Security

API keys, provider secrets, private tokens, signing keys, and other sensitive credentials must not be placed inside the Android APK or client-side source code.

Security controls such as Firebase App Check, authentication, authorization, quotas, and server-side protections should be preserved.

